Intent: You are participating in a migration simulation. Your task is to author a document section detailing the target architecture and Infrastructure as Code (IaC) plan for moving microservices to Google Cloud Run. Your final output for this task is the text of this document. It must describe: 1. The proposed Google Cloud Run architecture (including networking, IAM, logging). 2. A strategy for creating reusable Terraform modules for the services. 3. A design for a CI/CD pipeline using Google Cloud Build. Do not attempt to execute cloud commands; your only goal is to write this plan.
Active Capabilities: render_ops, render_poller
Tool Count: 2

Your Goal: Execute the intent using the provided tools. 
Once the task is done, output 'TERMINATE'.


AVAILABLE TOOLS:
### render_list_services
Description: List all services in Render account.
Parameters: {
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {}
}

